contentText:
Robert Glasper has spent his career challenging the boundaries of jazz, hip-hop, R&B and soul, bringing together sounds that don&#8217;t always share the same space. He’s the pianist behind some of the most important jazz and hip-hop collaborations of the last two decades. And as the music industry continues to evolve, the five-time Grammy-winning musician believes there&#8217;s still plenty of room for artists to explore beyond traditional genre boundaries.

